# Run logs never enter the repository (rl-code-quality-cleanup). Keep evidence
# logs outside the repo (/home/michael/work/infra-drafts/evidence/<change>/) and
# leave an EVIDENCE.md pointer. These rules come last so no earlier `!` re-includes logs.
**/run-logs/**
!**/run-logs/EVIDENCE.md
*.log
*.stderr
*.stdout
*metrics*.json
openspec/**/*.jsonl
openspec/**/*.out
openspec/**/*.err
